Errors Incorrect row numbers (grid conditions) or target counts (text conditions) were counted as errors. Errors by participant were analyzed using nonparametric methods because while the data was normally distributed, there were only 16 responses for each category. HUD usage was associated with more errors in both the text and grid visual search task conditions, with the vast majority of errors occurring in the text conditions. A Wilcoxon Signed Rank test indicated that using the HUD resulted in a slightly higher error count as compared to the HDD (S = 20.5, p = 0.0847).

